│    13     .sendmail(from_addr, to_addrs, msg) sends a raw MIME message over that                                                                            │
│    14     connection and returns an (empty-on-success) dict, raising                                                                                        │
│    15     smtplib.SMTPException/OSError subclasses on protocol or transport                                                                                 │
│    16     failure. apprise has no equivalent connection object: its unit of work                                                                            │
